    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this three bedroom, own door duplex to the market in the gated complex of Grangeview Place, Clondalkin. Ideally located within the Grange view development, this property finds itself within easy reach of Clondalkin Village and its host of amenities that it has to offer including shopping centres, schools, bars and recreational facilities. Bright, open and spacious living accommodation of c.113 sqm can be found here and in brief comprises of entrance hall, living room, kitchen/diner with balcony to rear, bedrooms 2 + 3 and a family bathroom to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find an XL master suite including dressing area and ensuite. Externally this property has communal gardens and a secure gated parking area. No. 61 comes to the market in good condition throughout and is offered to the market with no onward chain. Due to location, price and size we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest. \r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nBER C1\r\nc. 113 Sqm\r\nSecure gated development\r\nClose to local amenities\r\nOwn door duplex\r\nPopular location for first time buyers\r\nCommunal gardens\r\nDouble glazed windows \r\nGas central heating \r\nNo forward chain\r\nEarly viewing is a must\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nHeading onto Grange View Road from St Cuthberts Road. Follow the road all the way around to the right and continue straight until you reach the gates for Grangeview place."
      },
      {
